OL,3,GNEWSADisadvantaged pupils read less,
OL,4,Areport suggests
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe university made a series of
OL,7,Frecommendations for improvement
OL,8,Fincluding providing dedicated space and
OL,9,Ftime for young people to read and
OL,10,Finvesting in libraries where children
OL,11,Fcould choose books which suited them.
